      "value": "Explore <a href=\"/blog/\">my blog</a> and <a href=\"https://medium.com/@m1000z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Medium</a>, browse my projects on <a href=\"https://github.com/OldDiamond\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>, or connect with me on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/m1000z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LinkedIn</a>. You can also find my practice profile on <a href=\"https://profile.hackthebox.com/profile/019e4061-76f1-72dc-ab69-1bd0481cd557\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hack The Box</a>."
